/**
 * ============================================================================
 * MOCK SALES MONITORING SERVICE — NOT A PRODUCTION BACKEND
 * ============================================================================
 * Simulates the backend for the Merchandiser Monitoring module so the
 * frontend can be built and reviewed end to end.
 *
 * STRICT SCOPE RULES (mirrored from the agreed system design):
 *   - Exactly THREE SMS verification attempts per working shift.
 *   - Verification times are unpredictable and differ per employee per day.
 *     The real schedule is generated by the backend and is NEVER exposed here.
 *     This mock only produces HISTORICAL events (things that already happened).
 *     No future dispatch time is ever generated, returned or displayed.
 *   - No real SMS sending, no real face recognition, no real GPS tracking.
 *     All verification results are simulated records for demonstration.
 *   - The assigned shop belongs to the representative; it is never chosen at
 *     verification time.
 *   - The geofence radius is fixed at 150 metres.
 *   - Time zone: Africa/Accra (device-local time in this demo).
 *
 * Replace these functions with real API calls once the backend contract is
 * defined. Do NOT invent endpoints here.
 * ============================================================================
 */

